[
  {
    "start": "00:00:00.300",
    "end": "00:00:04.200",
    "start_seconds": 0.3,
    "end_seconds": 4.2,
    "text": "- Listening skills are a critical skill for every leader,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:04.200",
    "end": "00:00:05.700",
    "start_seconds": 4.2,
    "end_seconds": 5.7,
    "text": "and you're going to learn how to improve"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:05.700",
    "end": "00:00:07.440",
    "start_seconds": 5.7,
    "end_seconds": 7.44,
    "text": "your listening skills today."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:07.440",
    "end": "00:00:09.270",
    "start_seconds": 7.44,
    "end_seconds": 9.27,
    "text": "I'm here with my good friend and co-author,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:09.270",
    "end": "00:00:11.130",
    "start_seconds": 9.27,
    "end_seconds": 11.13,
    "text": "Dr. Julien Mirivel."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:11.130",
    "end": "00:00:13.500",
    "start_seconds": 11.13,
    "end_seconds": 13.5,
    "text": "We wrote a book called \"Positive Communication"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:13.500",
    "end": "00:00:16.500",
    "start_seconds": 13.5,
    "end_seconds": 16.5,
    "text": "For Leaders\" that this video series is based upon."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:16.500",
    "end": "00:00:20.730",
    "start_seconds": 16.5,
    "end_seconds": 20.73,
    "text": "In fact, this is the seventh and final video in this series."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:20.730",
    "end": "00:00:23.040",
    "start_seconds": 20.73,
    "end_seconds": 23.04,
    "text": "You can go back and watch the rest of the videos."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:23.040",
    "end": "00:00:24.480",
    "start_seconds": 23.04,
    "end_seconds": 24.48,
    "text": "We'll put links to the entire series"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:24.480",
    "end": "00:00:26.550",
    "start_seconds": 24.48,
    "end_seconds": 26.55,
    "text": "in the description below the video."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:26.550",
    "end": "00:00:29.580",
    "start_seconds": 26.55,
    "end_seconds": 29.58,
    "text": "And if you'd like to sign up for the free mini email class"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.580",
    "end": "00:00:31.530",
    "start_seconds": 29.58,
    "end_seconds": 31.53,
    "text": "that echoes everything we're talking about"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:31.530",
    "end": "00:00:33.270",
    "start_seconds": 31.53,
    "end_seconds": 33.27,
    "text": "in this series, you can do that as well."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:33.270",
    "end": "00:00:34.800",
    "start_seconds": 33.27,
    "end_seconds": 34.8,
    "text": "And by the way, I just wanna take a moment here"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:34.800",
    "end": "00:00:37.740",
    "start_seconds": 34.8,
    "end_seconds": 37.74,
    "text": "at the end of this series, if our names sound familiar,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:37.740",
    "end": "00:00:39.330",
    "start_seconds": 37.74,
    "end_seconds": 39.33,
    "text": "you may recognize us from our"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:39.330",
    "end": "00:00:42.630",
    "start_seconds": 39.33,
    "end_seconds": 42.63,
    "text": "blockbuster movie series, \"Madagascar.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:42.630",
    "end": "00:00:44.365",
    "start_seconds": 42.63,
    "end_seconds": 44.365,
    "text": "I am Alex, the Lion."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:44.365",
    "end": "00:00:47.550",
    "start_seconds": 44.365,
    "end_seconds": 47.55,
    "text": "Of course, he is the original King Julien."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:47.550",
    "end": "00:00:49.140",
    "start_seconds": 47.55,
    "end_seconds": 49.14,
    "text": "Now we're just joking, of course,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:49.140",
    "end": "00:00:52.590",
    "start_seconds": 49.14,
    "end_seconds": 52.59,
    "text": "but our names really are very similar,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:52.590",
    "end": "00:00:54.570",
    "start_seconds": 52.59,
    "end_seconds": 54.57,
    "text": "and we've had those names before those characters."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:54.570",
    "end": "00:00:57.120",
    "start_seconds": 54.57,
    "end_seconds": 57.12,
    "text": "And I actually do call Julien the original King Julien"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:57.120",
    "end": "00:00:57.960",
    "start_seconds": 57.12,
    "end_seconds": 57.96,
    "text": "for fun once in a while."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:57.960",
    "end": "00:01:00.630",
    "start_seconds": 57.96,
    "end_seconds": 60.63,
    "text": "And I've been called, many times, Alex the Lion."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:00.630",
    "end": "00:01:02.130",
    "start_seconds": 60.63,
    "end_seconds": 62.13,
    "text": "Anyway, back to our story."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:02.130",
    "end": "00:01:04.500",
    "start_seconds": 62.13,
    "end_seconds": 64.5,
    "text": "We're going to talk about listening."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:04.500",
    "end": "00:01:06.630",
    "start_seconds": 64.5,
    "end_seconds": 66.63,
    "text": "It's a key leadership behavior,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:06.630",
    "end": "00:01:09.720",
    "start_seconds": 66.63,
    "end_seconds": 69.72,
    "text": "and Julien's going to talk about this skill"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:09.720",
    "end": "00:01:11.280",
    "start_seconds": 69.72,
    "end_seconds": 71.28,
    "text": "from the perspective of his model"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:11.280",
    "end": "00:01:13.650",
    "start_seconds": 71.28,
    "end_seconds": 73.65,
    "text": "that he created on positive communication."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:13.650",
    "end": "00:01:16.679",
    "start_seconds": 73.65,
    "end_seconds": 76.679,
    "text": "- When you choose to listen as a leader, you are choosing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:16.679",
    "end": "00:01:19.620",
    "start_seconds": 76.679,
    "end_seconds": 79.62,
    "text": "to transcend the perceived differences that exist"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:19.620",
    "end": "00:01:21.720",
    "start_seconds": 79.62,
    "end_seconds": 81.72,
    "text": "between you and other people."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:21.720",
    "end": "00:01:23.220",
    "start_seconds": 81.72,
    "end_seconds": 83.22,
    "text": "Why is listening such an important"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:23.220",
    "end": "00:01:24.840",
    "start_seconds": 83.22,
    "end_seconds": 84.84,
    "text": "leadership behavior, Alex?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:24.840",
    "end": "00:01:26.880",
    "start_seconds": 84.84,
    "end_seconds": 86.88,
    "text": "- Well, listening is an often overlooked"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:26.880",
    "end": "00:01:29.580",
    "start_seconds": 86.88,
    "end_seconds": 89.58,
    "text": "and usually undervalued communication skill."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:29.580",
    "end": "00:01:31.920",
    "start_seconds": 89.58,
    "end_seconds": 91.92,
    "text": "It often doesn't look like anything's happening,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:31.920",
    "end": "00:01:34.050",
    "start_seconds": 91.92,
    "end_seconds": 94.05,
    "text": "but if you want to take your leadership seriously,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:34.050",
    "end": "00:01:35.970",
    "start_seconds": 94.05,
    "end_seconds": 95.97,
    "text": "then you have to work on your listening."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:35.970",
    "end": "00:01:39.540",
    "start_seconds": 95.97,
    "end_seconds": 99.53999999999999,
    "text": "Because the higher up leaders go in any organization,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:39.540",
    "end": "00:01:41.640",
    "start_seconds": 99.53999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 101.64,
    "text": "the more time they spend listening."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:41.640",
    "end": "00:01:44.670",
    "start_seconds": 101.64,
    "end_seconds": 104.67,
    "text": "In fact, as we show in our book, executives spend twice"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:44.670",
    "end": "00:01:47.820",
    "start_seconds": 104.67,
    "end_seconds": 107.82,
    "text": "as much time listening compared to the average employee."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.820",
    "end": "00:01:50.970",
    "start_seconds": 107.82,
    "end_seconds": 110.97,
    "text": "And emerging leaders spend more and more time listening"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:50.970",
    "end": "00:01:55.500",
    "start_seconds": 110.97,
    "end_seconds": 115.5,
    "text": "as they move up the ladder in any kind of organization."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:55.500",
    "end": "00:01:57.840",
    "start_seconds": 115.5,
    "end_seconds": 117.84,
    "text": "And people in all walks of life,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:57.840",
    "end": "00:01:59.250",
    "start_seconds": 117.84,
    "end_seconds": 119.25,
    "text": "whether they're in an organization"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:59.250",
    "end": "00:02:03.360",
    "start_seconds": 119.25,
    "end_seconds": 123.36,
    "text": "or in their personal life, love great listeners."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:03.360",
    "end": "00:02:06.090",
    "start_seconds": 123.36,
    "end_seconds": 126.09,
    "text": "- But there are real important practical benefits"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:06.090",
    "end": "00:02:08.130",
    "start_seconds": 126.09,
    "end_seconds": 128.13,
    "text": "to being a great listener."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:08.130",
    "end": "00:02:10.740",
    "start_seconds": 128.13,
    "end_seconds": 130.74,
    "text": "Leaders who listen well and deeply"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:10.740",
    "end": "00:02:12.810",
    "start_seconds": 130.74,
    "end_seconds": 132.81,
    "text": "get to know their people better."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:12.810",
    "end": "00:02:15.450",
    "start_seconds": 132.81,
    "end_seconds": 135.45,
    "text": "They also can be more easily identifying"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:15.450",
    "end": "00:02:18.510",
    "start_seconds": 135.45,
    "end_seconds": 138.51,
    "text": "the emerging problems that are taking place on the ground."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:18.510",
    "end": "00:02:20.730",
    "start_seconds": 138.51,
    "end_seconds": 140.73,
    "text": "They have more input about solutions"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:20.730",
    "end": "00:02:24.180",
    "start_seconds": 140.73,
    "end_seconds": 144.18,
    "text": "that could be more effective to solve real problems."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:24.180",
    "end": "00:02:26.460",
    "start_seconds": 144.18,
    "end_seconds": 146.46,
    "text": "They also are really good if you use listening,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:26.460",
    "end": "00:02:29.490",
    "start_seconds": 146.46,
    "end_seconds": 149.49,
    "text": "you can resolve the problems before they get bigger."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:29.490",
    "end": "00:02:31.890",
    "start_seconds": 149.49,
    "end_seconds": 151.89,
    "text": "And more importantly, most of us, we want to avoid"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:31.890",
    "end": "00:02:34.470",
    "start_seconds": 151.89,
    "end_seconds": 154.47,
    "text": "hard conversations, difficult moments."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:34.470",
    "end": "00:02:36.900",
    "start_seconds": 154.47,
    "end_seconds": 156.9,
    "text": "If you can listen a little bit more deeply,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:36.900",
    "end": "00:02:38.610",
    "start_seconds": 156.9,
    "end_seconds": 158.61,
    "text": "you can avoid these hard talks"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:38.610",
    "end": "00:02:41.550",
    "start_seconds": 158.61,
    "end_seconds": 161.55,
    "text": "because you're managing problems all along the way."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:41.550",
    "end": "00:02:44.490",
    "start_seconds": 161.55,
    "end_seconds": 164.49,
    "text": "For these reasons, it doesn't surprise us that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:44.490",
    "end": "00:02:47.340",
    "start_seconds": 164.49,
    "end_seconds": 167.34,
    "text": "some of the best listeners we've ever met"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:47.340",
    "end": "00:02:50.880",
    "start_seconds": 167.34,
    "end_seconds": 170.88,
    "text": "are leaders sitting at the top of the organizational chart."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:50.880",
    "end": "00:02:53.160",
    "start_seconds": 170.88,
    "end_seconds": 173.16,
    "text": "- So what does good listening look like,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:53.160",
    "end": "00:02:55.170",
    "start_seconds": 173.16,
    "end_seconds": 175.17000000000002,
    "text": "sound like, and feel like?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:55.170",
    "end": "00:02:57.390",
    "start_seconds": 175.17000000000002,
    "end_seconds": 177.39,
    "text": "Well, in our book, we use the term deep listening"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:57.390",
    "end": "00:03:00.450",
    "start_seconds": 177.39,
    "end_seconds": 180.45,
    "text": "to indicate that listening well goes beyond"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:00.450",
    "end": "00:03:03.210",
    "start_seconds": 180.45,
    "end_seconds": 183.21,
    "text": "superficial tactics, like fake listening,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:03.210",
    "end": "00:03:05.400",
    "start_seconds": 183.21,
    "end_seconds": 185.4,
    "text": "to give people the impression"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:05.400",
    "end": "00:03:07.200",
    "start_seconds": 185.4,
    "end_seconds": 187.2,
    "text": "that you're listening when you're not."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:07.200",
    "end": "00:03:11.370",
    "start_seconds": 187.2,
    "end_seconds": 191.37,
    "text": "For example, deep listeners follow three key behaviors."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:11.370",
    "end": "00:03:13.530",
    "start_seconds": 191.37,
    "end_seconds": 193.53,
    "text": "First, deep listeners are fully present"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:13.530",
    "end": "00:03:16.170",
    "start_seconds": 193.53,
    "end_seconds": 196.17000000000002,
    "text": "and completely in the moment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:16.170",
    "end": "00:03:18.360",
    "start_seconds": 196.17000000000002,
    "end_seconds": 198.36,
    "text": "Deep listeners put their phones away."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:18.360",
    "end": "00:03:20.340",
    "start_seconds": 198.36,
    "end_seconds": 200.34,
    "text": "They reduce all distractions."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:20.340",
    "end": "00:03:22.290",
    "start_seconds": 200.34,
    "end_seconds": 202.29,
    "text": "They literally lean their bodies in"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:22.290",
    "end": "00:03:25.980",
    "start_seconds": 202.29,
    "end_seconds": 205.98,
    "text": "and they listen with their eyes, not just their ears."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.980",
    "end": "00:03:28.230",
    "start_seconds": 205.98,
    "end_seconds": 208.23,
    "text": "Deep listeners, for example, are never looking"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:28.230",
    "end": "00:03:30.240",
    "start_seconds": 208.23,
    "end_seconds": 210.24,
    "text": "over your shoulder to see who else might be"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.240",
    "end": "00:03:32.610",
    "start_seconds": 210.24,
    "end_seconds": 212.61,
    "text": "a little more interesting in the room."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:32.610",
    "end": "00:03:34.800",
    "start_seconds": 212.61,
    "end_seconds": 214.8,
    "text": "And a fully present listener makes you feel"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:34.800",
    "end": "00:03:37.170",
    "start_seconds": 214.8,
    "end_seconds": 217.17000000000002,
    "text": "like you're the most important person"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:37.170",
    "end": "00:03:39.150",
    "start_seconds": 217.17000000000002,
    "end_seconds": 219.15,
    "text": "in the world at that moment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.150",
    "end": "00:03:42.030",
    "start_seconds": 219.15,
    "end_seconds": 222.03,
    "text": "They're fully present, and that is a choice."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:42.030",
    "end": "00:03:44.640",
    "start_seconds": 222.03,
    "end_seconds": 224.64,
    "text": "For example, they say that Elvis Presley"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.640",
    "end": "00:03:47.100",
    "start_seconds": 224.64,
    "end_seconds": 227.1,
    "text": "made you feel like you were the only person that existed"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:47.100",
    "end": "00:03:50.430",
    "start_seconds": 227.1,
    "end_seconds": 230.43,
    "text": "in the entire universe while he was speaking to you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:50.430",
    "end": "00:03:51.900",
    "start_seconds": 230.43,
    "end_seconds": 231.9,
    "text": "He made you feel special."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:51.900",
    "end": "00:03:55.020",
    "start_seconds": 231.9,
    "end_seconds": 235.02,
    "text": "And if the king of rock and roll had the time"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:55.020",
    "end": "00:03:57.570",
    "start_seconds": 235.02,
    "end_seconds": 237.57,
    "text": "to make people feel that way, so can you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:57.570",
    "end": "00:04:00.660",
    "start_seconds": 237.57,
    "end_seconds": 240.66,
    "text": "- Deep listeners are also open."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:00.660",
    "end": "00:04:03.060",
    "start_seconds": 240.66,
    "end_seconds": 243.06,
    "text": "Openness is about welcoming new ideas,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:03.060",
    "end": "00:04:04.920",
    "start_seconds": 243.06,
    "end_seconds": 244.92,
    "text": "perspectives, and approaches."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:04.920",
    "end": "00:04:06.960",
    "start_seconds": 244.92,
    "end_seconds": 246.96,
    "text": "We know that remaining open is difficult,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.960",
    "end": "00:04:09.660",
    "start_seconds": 246.96,
    "end_seconds": 249.66,
    "text": "but it does not mean abandoning your point of view."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:09.660",
    "end": "00:04:13.230",
    "start_seconds": 249.66,
    "end_seconds": 253.23,
    "text": "In fact, openness is all about maintaining a really fine,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:13.230",
    "end": "00:04:17.010",
    "start_seconds": 253.23,
    "end_seconds": 257.01,
    "text": "delicate balance between holding onto your own perspective"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:17.010",
    "end": "00:04:20.790",
    "start_seconds": 257.01,
    "end_seconds": 260.79,
    "text": "and being profoundly open to the perspective of others."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:20.790",
    "end": "00:04:23.460",
    "start_seconds": 260.79,
    "end_seconds": 263.46,
    "text": "Openness is typically difficult for people to develop"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:23.460",
    "end": "00:04:26.010",
    "start_seconds": 263.46,
    "end_seconds": 266.01,
    "text": "because it involves our ability to accept"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:26.010",
    "end": "00:04:27.660",
    "start_seconds": 266.01,
    "end_seconds": 267.66,
    "text": "and welcome new information,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:27.660",
    "end": "00:04:30.120",
    "start_seconds": 267.66,
    "end_seconds": 270.12,
    "text": "which may even contradict our own thinking."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:30.120",
    "end": "00:04:32.790",
    "start_seconds": 270.12,
    "end_seconds": 272.79,
    "text": "We interviewed a variety of leaders for the book that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:32.790",
    "end": "00:04:35.647",
    "start_seconds": 272.79,
    "end_seconds": 275.647,
    "text": "Alex and I wrote, but one of them said this,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:35.647",
    "end": "00:04:38.340",
    "start_seconds": 275.647,
    "end_seconds": 278.34000000000003,
    "text": "\"Leaders, in general, are very stubborn."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:38.340",
    "end": "00:04:41.010",
    "start_seconds": 278.34000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 281.01,
    "text": "They believe in something and they keep on pushing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:41.010",
    "end": "00:04:43.890",
    "start_seconds": 281.01,
    "end_seconds": 283.89,
    "text": "whether people agree or disagree.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:43.890",
    "end": "00:04:47.347",
    "start_seconds": 283.89,
    "end_seconds": 287.347,
    "text": "But he added this important piece of information, he said,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:47.347",
    "end": "00:04:49.950",
    "start_seconds": 287.347,
    "end_seconds": 289.95,
    "text": "\"But I have found that listening deeply"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:49.950",
    "end": "00:04:52.980",
    "start_seconds": 289.95,
    "end_seconds": 292.98,
    "text": "always gives me a new perspective.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:52.980",
    "end": "00:04:54.600",
    "start_seconds": 292.98,
    "end_seconds": 294.6,
    "text": "So gaining a fresh perspective,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:54.600",
    "end": "00:04:57.360",
    "start_seconds": 294.6,
    "end_seconds": 297.36,
    "text": "even if one may not fully change their view,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:57.360",
    "end": "00:04:59.310",
    "start_seconds": 297.36,
    "end_seconds": 299.31,
    "text": "is obviously critical for leaders."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:59.310",
    "end": "00:05:02.070",
    "start_seconds": 299.31,
    "end_seconds": 302.07,
    "text": "So as a leader, we encourage you to remain open"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:02.070",
    "end": "00:05:04.950",
    "start_seconds": 302.07,
    "end_seconds": 304.95,
    "text": "to hearing new ideas, to hearing new thoughts"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:04.950",
    "end": "00:05:07.830",
    "start_seconds": 304.95,
    "end_seconds": 307.83,
    "text": "and constructs that will help you innovate, adapt,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:07.830",
    "end": "00:05:09.420",
    "start_seconds": 307.83,
    "end_seconds": 309.42,
    "text": "and hopefully thrive."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:09.420",
    "end": "00:05:12.960",
    "start_seconds": 309.42,
    "end_seconds": 312.96,
    "text": "- The third behavior is that deep listeners show empathy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:12.960",
    "end": "00:05:15.960",
    "start_seconds": 312.96,
    "end_seconds": 315.96,
    "text": "Put simply, empathy is your ability to put yourself"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:15.960",
    "end": "00:05:19.080",
    "start_seconds": 315.96,
    "end_seconds": 319.08,
    "text": "in the other person's shoes to understand their world"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:19.080",
    "end": "00:05:21.870",
    "start_seconds": 319.08,
    "end_seconds": 321.87,
    "text": "and to feel what they are feeling in that moment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:21.870",
    "end": "00:05:24.720",
    "start_seconds": 321.87,
    "end_seconds": 324.72,
    "text": "Empathy usually involves pitching back"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:24.720",
    "end": "00:05:26.640",
    "start_seconds": 324.72,
    "end_seconds": 326.64,
    "text": "what you believe you have heard"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:26.640",
    "end": "00:05:28.710",
    "start_seconds": 326.64,
    "end_seconds": 328.71,
    "text": "or asking a few follow-up questions"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:28.710",
    "end": "00:05:30.840",
    "start_seconds": 328.71,
    "end_seconds": 330.84,
    "text": "to make sure you are understanding the other person's"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:30.840",
    "end": "00:05:33.150",
    "start_seconds": 330.84,
    "end_seconds": 333.15,
    "text": "point of view accurately."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:33.150",
    "end": "00:05:35.760",
    "start_seconds": 333.15,
    "end_seconds": 335.76,
    "text": "So I'm gonna give you a few straightforward examples of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:35.760",
    "end": "00:05:38.370",
    "start_seconds": 335.76,
    "end_seconds": 338.37,
    "text": "how you might respond in the moment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:38.370",
    "end": "00:05:40.230",
    "start_seconds": 338.37,
    "end_seconds": 340.23,
    "text": "We're gonna be really straightforward here."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:40.230",
    "end": "00:05:42.060",
    "start_seconds": 340.23,
    "end_seconds": 342.06,
    "text": "When good listeners respond,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:42.060",
    "end": "00:05:45.540",
    "start_seconds": 342.06,
    "end_seconds": 345.54,
    "text": "they keep their responses low key."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:45.540",
    "end": "00:05:47.887",
    "start_seconds": 345.54,
    "end_seconds": 347.887,
    "text": "For example, they may say things like,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:47.887",
    "end": "00:05:51.660",
    "start_seconds": 347.887,
    "end_seconds": 351.65999999999997,
    "text": "\"I hear you,\" \"Makes sense,\" \"I see what you mean,\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:51.660",
    "end": "00:05:53.790",
    "start_seconds": 351.65999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 353.79,
    "text": "or even simply, \"Hm.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:53.790",
    "end": "00:05:56.490",
    "start_seconds": 353.79,
    "end_seconds": 356.49,
    "text": "You'll notice that these replies are all very short."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:56.490",
    "end": "00:05:58.200",
    "start_seconds": 356.49,
    "end_seconds": 358.2,
    "text": "Great listeners are not eager"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:58.200",
    "end": "00:06:00.420",
    "start_seconds": 358.2,
    "end_seconds": 360.42,
    "text": "to take their own big talking turn"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:00.420",
    "end": "00:06:03.630",
    "start_seconds": 360.42,
    "end_seconds": 363.63,
    "text": "or to jump in with a story to match your story."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:03.630",
    "end": "00:06:06.480",
    "start_seconds": 363.63,
    "end_seconds": 366.48,
    "text": "They're entirely focused on understanding you"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:06.480",
    "end": "00:06:08.760",
    "start_seconds": 366.48,
    "end_seconds": 368.76,
    "text": "and understanding your world."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:08.760",
    "end": "00:06:10.417",
    "start_seconds": 368.76,
    "end_seconds": 370.417,
    "text": "As Stephen Covey might say,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:10.417",
    "end": "00:06:13.080",
    "start_seconds": 370.417,
    "end_seconds": 373.08,
    "text": "\"Great listeners listen to understand."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:13.080",
    "end": "00:06:15.810",
    "start_seconds": 373.08,
    "end_seconds": 375.81,
    "text": "They don't listen to simply reply.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:15.810",
    "end": "00:06:18.450",
    "start_seconds": 375.81,
    "end_seconds": 378.45,
    "text": "- Let's get actionable, here is your challenge."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:18.450",
    "end": "00:06:20.070",
    "start_seconds": 378.45,
    "end_seconds": 380.07,
    "text": "This is a simple action step,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:20.070",
    "end": "00:06:23.340",
    "start_seconds": 380.07,
    "end_seconds": 383.34,
    "text": "but it takes commitment, and courage on your part"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:23.340",
    "end": "00:06:25.800",
    "start_seconds": 383.34,
    "end_seconds": 385.8,
    "text": "to execute this challenge."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:25.800",
    "end": "00:06:30.060",
    "start_seconds": 385.8,
    "end_seconds": 390.06,
    "text": "In the next 24 hours, strive to make listening"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:30.060",
    "end": "00:06:33.750",
    "start_seconds": 390.06,
    "end_seconds": 393.75,
    "text": "your dominant goal in any conversation that you're having."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:33.750",
    "end": "00:06:35.550",
    "start_seconds": 393.75,
    "end_seconds": 395.55,
    "text": "It's gonna be your purpose."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:35.550",
    "end": "00:06:37.500",
    "start_seconds": 395.55,
    "end_seconds": 397.5,
    "text": "Use the tips that we've shared in this video"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:37.500",
    "end": "00:06:40.470",
    "start_seconds": 397.5,
    "end_seconds": 400.47,
    "text": "to listen more effectively and more deeply."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:40.470",
    "end": "00:06:43.050",
    "start_seconds": 400.47,
    "end_seconds": 403.05,
    "text": "Remember that it's a part of your job."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:43.050",
    "end": "00:06:44.310",
    "start_seconds": 403.05,
    "end_seconds": 404.31,
    "text": "Here's a quick summary."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:44.310",
    "end": "00:06:48.120",
    "start_seconds": 404.31,
    "end_seconds": 408.12,
    "text": "Recognize that listening is a leadership responsibility."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:48.120",
    "end": "00:06:52.050",
    "start_seconds": 408.12,
    "end_seconds": 412.05,
    "text": "And deep listening means that you become fully present,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:52.050",
    "end": "00:06:55.950",
    "start_seconds": 412.05,
    "end_seconds": 415.95,
    "text": "that you become fully open, and that you become empathetic."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:55.950",
    "end": "00:06:57.870",
    "start_seconds": 415.95,
    "end_seconds": 417.87,
    "text": "We know that listening in one-on-one"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:57.870",
    "end": "00:06:59.970",
    "start_seconds": 417.87,
    "end_seconds": 419.97,
    "text": "conversations is foundational."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:59.970",
    "end": "00:07:02.790",
    "start_seconds": 419.97,
    "end_seconds": 422.79,
    "text": "And in our book, we also explain how you can use the power"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:02.790",
    "end": "00:07:05.790",
    "start_seconds": 422.79,
    "end_seconds": 425.79,
    "text": "of listening to build an extraordinary team"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:05.790",
    "end": "00:07:08.010",
    "start_seconds": 425.79,
    "end_seconds": 428.01,
    "text": "and a great organizational culture,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:08.010",
    "end": "00:07:10.380",
    "start_seconds": 428.01,
    "end_seconds": 430.38,
    "text": "heart and centered on compassion."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:10.380",
    "end": "00:07:12.750",
    "start_seconds": 430.38,
    "end_seconds": 432.75,
    "text": "- As mentioned, this is the seventh"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:12.750",
    "end": "00:07:15.480",
    "start_seconds": 432.75,
    "end_seconds": 435.48,
    "text": "of seven videos in this series on positive"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:15.480",
    "end": "00:07:17.280",
    "start_seconds": 435.48,
    "end_seconds": 437.28,
    "text": "communication for leaders."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:17.280",
    "end": "00:07:19.440",
    "start_seconds": 437.28,
    "end_seconds": 439.44,
    "text": "Feel free to look at the entire series."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:19.440",
    "end": "00:07:21.150",
    "start_seconds": 439.44,
    "end_seconds": 441.15,
    "text": "We'll put links to the whole thing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:21.150",
    "end": "00:07:23.850",
    "start_seconds": 441.15,
    "end_seconds": 443.85,
    "text": "in the description below the video, as well as links"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:23.850",
    "end": "00:07:28.200",
    "start_seconds": 443.85,
    "end_seconds": 448.2,
    "text": "to the book on Amazon and that free mini email class."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:28.200",
    "end": "00:07:29.880",
    "start_seconds": 448.2,
    "end_seconds": 449.88,
    "text": "And if you've watched this whole series,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:29.880",
    "end": "00:07:32.820",
    "start_seconds": 449.88,
    "end_seconds": 452.82,
    "text": "I just want to encourage you to leave a comment below."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:32.820",
    "end": "00:07:35.070",
    "start_seconds": 452.82,
    "end_seconds": 455.07,
    "text": "Tell us you've watched the entire series,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:35.070",
    "end": "00:07:37.200",
    "start_seconds": 455.07,
    "end_seconds": 457.2,
    "text": "and I'll be sure to heart your response"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:37.200",
    "end": "00:07:39.900",
    "start_seconds": 457.2,
    "end_seconds": 459.9,
    "text": "and also respond to what you have written."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:39.900",
    "end": "00:07:42.870",
    "start_seconds": 459.9,
    "end_seconds": 462.87,
    "text": "And I just wanna say thank you for hanging in there with us."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:42.870",
    "end": "00:07:44.670",
    "start_seconds": 462.87,
    "end_seconds": 464.67,
    "text": "This is Alex the Lion"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:44.670",
    "end": "00:07:47.340",
    "start_seconds": 464.67,
    "end_seconds": 467.34000000000003,
    "text": "and the original King Julien signing off for this series."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:47.340",
    "end": "00:07:48.900",
    "start_seconds": 467.34000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 468.9,
    "text": "Until next time, thanks, God bless,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:48.900",
    "end": "00:07:50.150",
    "start_seconds": 468.9,
    "end_seconds": 470.15,
    "text": "and we will see you soon."
  }
]
